    "detailed_description": "Draft - In the woods is a casual puzzle game.<br><br>Your goal is to remove grid nodes using pencil drawn lines.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Featuring:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Grid movement in turns, you play with the pencil and need to cross a drawn line without colliding with enemy objects such as erasers, erasers or concealers.<br></li><li> Solve <strong>30 progressive levels</strong> that challenge your ability to memorize patterns.<br></li><li> Enemies and power-ups with different mechanics that teach you how they work at each stage.<br></li><li> No distractions, put on your headphones and relax in a unique challenge.<br></li><li> <strong>Original soundtrack</strong>, specially composed to keep you focused.<br></li><li> No counters or scores, in draft you forget about the world around you and have fun.</li></ul><br>Can you destroy all the nodes? Give it a try and prove that you are a real Drafter.",
    "about_the_game": "Draft - In the woods is a casual puzzle game.<br><br>Your goal is to remove grid nodes using pencil drawn lines.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Featuring:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Grid movement in turns, you play with the pencil and need to cross a drawn line without colliding with enemy objects such as erasers, erasers or concealers.<br></li><li> Solve <strong>30 progressive levels</strong> that challenge your ability to memorize patterns.<br></li><li> Enemies and power-ups with different mechanics that teach you how they work at each stage.<br></li><li> No distractions, put on your headphones and relax in a unique challenge.<br></li><li> <strong>Original soundtrack</strong>, specially composed to keep you focused.<br></li><li> No counters or scores, in draft you forget about the world around you and have fun.</li></ul><br>Can you destroy all the nodes? Give it a try and prove that you are a real Drafter.",
    "short_description": "Draft - In the woods is a casual, relaxing and challenging puzzle game. Solve the levels by removing all the nodes using neatly drawn line cuts.",
